  cardArt: {fileID: -292687858937536223, guid: 3a4d3b7160ccaa141bed74d33d424685, type: 3}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'Youngest among the strangers. Confident, agile and sneaky Kharian
    boy who lost his mother at a young age. He swore revenge on the men that murdered
    her by any means necessary. He joined a criminal group led by Henry, who he sees
    as a father figure. Throughout the years Henry taught Abdul skills that would
    help him in his quest. Young boy named Usman Abdul Jalil Shisha proved himself
    a capable thief and assassin ready to take any task given to him at the ripe
    age of 16. He lost his right arm to a mythical creature known as Bagman, which
    he thankfully replaced with a mechanical prototype in Brasshaven. '
